sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as 用户
    participant UI as M01 桌面交互
    participant APP as M02 应用协调
    participant G as M03 ResearchLoopGraph
    participant DT as M05 数据与执行
    participant ER as M06 评估与交付
    participant ST as M07 状态与契约

    U->>UI: 确认当前方案
    UI->>APP: resume(approve, plan_id, fingerprint)
    APP->>G: Command(resume=approval)
    G->>G: 校验审批事实并 lock_plan
    G->>ST: checkpoint 授权信封与工具队列
    loop 每个 ToolCall
        G->>DT: execute_call(approved ToolCall)
        DT-->>G: ToolResult + output_hash
        G->>G: validate_tool_result
        G->>ST: checkpoint 已提交结果
    end
    G->>ER: finalize(plan, quality, merged evidence)
    ER-->>G: AgentEvaluation = accept
    ER->>ST: 写入研究包、manifest 和哈希
    ST-->>ER: ArtifactBundle 路径
    ER-->>G: report_path + artifact_directory
    G-->>APP: result interrupt + completed snapshot
    APP-->>UI: 结果、事件和报告引用
    UI-->>U: 展示结果卡并打开报告

